# Debug the running app

`npm run tauri dev` → WKWebView (no CDP). Browser on **:1420** is not the desktop app.

Debug MCP: `tauri-plugin-mcp-bridge`, **127.0.0.1:9223** (`.cursor/mcp.json`). Start once per `tauri dev`:

```bash
npx -y -p @hypothesi/tauri-mcp-cli tauri-mcp driver-session start --port 9223
npx -y -p @hypothesi/tauri-mcp-cli tauri-mcp webview-screenshot --file /tmp/dev-doctor.png
npx -y -p @hypothesi/tauri-mcp-cli tauri-mcp webview-interact --action click --selector '<css>'
```

UI change unfinished until screenshot + exercise changed control. Compare `window_chrome` with toggle `getBoundingClientRect()` when title row changes.

No in-app layout harness overlay.

